#   on the bot service:  BOT_BRIDGE_SECRET (24+ random chars), BRIDGE_PORT
#   on the web service:  BOT_BRIDGE_URL (e.g. http://bot.railway.internal:3001) and the same BOT_BRIDGE_SECRET
